From b3c1594da4c1b31b56ff3206bc89102971693495 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Glauber Franco <gnfranco@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:47:38 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] radio: add opt-in Wi-Fi-only engineering profile

Retain combined defaults, isolate the SRAM manifest and preserve the radio ABI. Record local A/B and profile switching results, including outstanding validation limitations.

Developed with assistance from ChatGPT.

Signed-off-by: Glauber Franco <gnfranco@gmail.com>
---
